# Files that must NOT be sent to Docker as the build "context". Smaller context = faster build, and nothing private ends up in an image.
# (The Dockerfiles of lessons 45-48 use the repository root as their context.)
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
*.iml
**/target
**/shop-data
**/*.mv.db
**/*.trace.db
**/*.lock.db
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
docs
templates
